    },
    {
        "text": "Sora, are you alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I'm fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you going after Texas?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I saw her a minute ago, she told me to wait for her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_201_moeshd_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's hunker down until this mess blows over. It's total mayhem out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't want to lose her, you're gonna wanna go after her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lappland...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_201_moeshd_1#15$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
