    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I feel like it's the same with Lappland.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "For people like her, there's no point trying to guess at what they're thinking. It's better to just accept what they say at face value.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only if every word they say is true can you start to figure if they're ultimately trying to weave truths into a lie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
