        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_201_moeshd_1#15$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, do you know who it is waiting in that room?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Giovanna Rossati.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If there's anyone who could actually get Texas to come back to Siracusa...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It ain't me, or Bernardo. And it sure as hell isn't Signora Sicilia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's her, Giovanna.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
