        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$drift_intro",
        "key": "$drift_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cellinia, you're a lot taller than you used to be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Makes sense, doesn't it? It's been years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, I met some of your friends from Lungmen. Your name came up a few times, and from what they said, I can tell they're worried about you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I didn't think they'd come here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're nothing like them, at all. I never thought you'd make such lively, outgoing friends with that personality of yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't count?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you really thought I was your friend, you wouldn't have gone so long without writing me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. I know you must be hiding something else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The liquidation came too suddenly. None of Columbia's famiglie could sleep at night. I couldn't bear to see that any longer, so I stood up to take charge of the situation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I opened up talks with Signora Sicilia, and we basically managed to sort things out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's all there is to it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You make it sound so easy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, I should be complaining to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's been too long since I've had anyone to confide in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So that's why you poured your heart and soul into your scripts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, could you tell? 'La Morte di Texas' my magnum opus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There were some details in it that only you'd know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess that means my memory's pretty good then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I could never decide on what to do with Act III, with your 'death.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess there's no need to think about it anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, becoming a playwright had another purpose. It's an open secret that Bernardo passed responsibility for the famiglia to his son, while he went on to become the artistic director of his troupe, Compagnia dell'alba.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wanted a chance to meet him. You know, there aren't many mafiosi who would do something like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the one who ended up shattering all expectations, was him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess I should've expected it after all, from the man who built Famiglia Bellone into what it is in just a single generation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the looks of things, he really wants to challenge Signora Sicilia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't seem worried about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I can say is, if Bernardo considers you his trump card against the Rossatis, he's counting his fowlbeasts before they've hatched.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were right to come to me, Cellinia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what's going on between you and the Bellones, I can help you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Join me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The two of us, together, will make a difference in Siracusa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And not just because you're Salvadore's granddaughter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I know you, Cellinia. You can make a difference.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll start over together, Cellinia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you want to know how I managed to survive?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Giovanna, it was no fluke that I survived the liquidation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
