    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "33_g4_srctheater",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you're here, standing on this stage, performing this play... How much do you know about what happened seven years ago?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seven years ago... Texas's father, Giuseppe, murdered his own father, Salvadore, and declared that the Texases would no longer operate under Siracusa's control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That upset Signora Sicilia, who sent an elite force from the Twelve Families to Columbia to 'liquidate' the Texas Family.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were part of that, weren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look who's such a smarty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the time, Cellinia Texas was a star-studded name. She was Columbian, but even the Siracusans had nothing but wonderful things to say about her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This whole time... you've been trying to beat Texas?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Beat her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no, no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back when the Saluzzos were looking after her, we were pretty competitive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sometimes I'd win our little contests, sometimes I'd lose.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I did want to beat her, but that had nothing to do with what happened later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You certainly do care deeply for her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, that has nothing to do with the plot of the story either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "At least tell me what happened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I joined in the liquidation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was fantasizing about how she would fight me to the death for the sake of her famiglia. It got my heart pounding and my blood racing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, nothing could've prepared me for what I saw that day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
