    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a hitman too, aren't you, Danbrown?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Signorina Lavinia, seven years ago, I was part of the team that carried out the liquidation of Famiglia Texas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I arrived in the city ahead of time, took up a job at a carwash, and secretly observed the Texases' every move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, the team from Siracusa arrived.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And a group of Columbians found me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Columbian mafiosi are pretty careless. Real full of themselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I could've dealt with them easy enough, if it wasn't for that one girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew her. She was a Texas, but everyone said she was like a Siracusan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Cellinia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I see you, I'm sometimes reminded of her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was she as stupid as me, rambling on about ideals with a murderer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Signorina Lavinia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never meant to make fun of your ideals. It's just... I can barely believe it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hearing you talk about that stuff... it's like listening to a real pretty fairy tale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "To me, your ideals are so pretty, they're a kind of shortcut to get me a good night's sleep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That day, I was ready to fight for my life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was convinced she would see right through me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
        "name2": "char_empty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_693_1#5$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_693_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She let me walk right by her, just like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "33_g4_srctheater",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "The audience has scattered in every direction. The battle between murderers has moved on."
    },
    {
        "text": "The theater has emptied out."
    },
    {
        "text": "As Lappland speaks, she takes light dance steps out onto the empty stage."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The associates of Famiglia Texas were already pretty much wiped out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, what about Cellinia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She was the only one missing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We couldn't let anyone live to talk about what happened, especially not the eldest daughter. So, we all went to track her down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that was when chaos broke out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Texas mansion went up in flames, burning away the famiglia's very existence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the arsonist... was standing there at the front door.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right in front of me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She slowly turned and walked towards me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "At that moment, I understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She decided to stand by and watch the end of her own famiglia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But who could blame her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her father murdered her grandfather, and didn't want to be an accomplice to that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only she had the right to blame herself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, there's more to it than that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I looked into her eyes, what I saw was\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exhaustion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "33_g11_mansionhall",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cellinia's story... is no secret to Famiglia Saluzzo, or to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, the one who led the Saluzzo team at the time was none other than Signorina Lappland.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She got kicked out because she went out on her own to hunt down Cellinia. Her men got caught up in a counterattack, and a lot of them died.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't run away, nor will I avert my eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "For so long, she has told herself as much."
    },
    {
        "text": "But this time, her words fail her."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at the bodies on the street, Lavinia. Listen to the shouts and cries in the distance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What can you do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The only advice I can give you is the same I gave to Cellinia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Run.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The farther, the better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if your past is going to catch up to you, you'll at least enjoy a moment of peace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_693_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise\u2014 you <i>will</i> die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carwash Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still don't want to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
