    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her past kicked down her door.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It might've been against her will at first, but she was forced out only to find nothing changed\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe she'll decide the things she ran away from weren't actually all that bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her life in Lungmen... might've been a slightly extended vacation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And now, the one most intimately connected with her family and her past... is standing right in front of her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what you wanted to tell me, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that's the case... I will respect her decision.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though you're her best friend?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_684_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I'm her best friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_201_moeshd_1#14$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Darn tootin'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_103_angel_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unless\u2014 the pizza in Siracusa becomes inedible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "33_g11_mansionhall",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My grandfather was a sentimental man. He sent me to Siracusa, hoping I would remember my roots.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I lived there for a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "People there told me all the time that I fit in, like a Siracusan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But for me, I was just doing what I'd always been doing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The way I lived my life in Columbia was no different than the way I lived in Siracusa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what I saw in Siracusa was no different from what I saw in Columbia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You might know the story of Famiglia Texas like the back of your hand, but I saw it with my own eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Life isn't a play where every move is sprinkled with a little heroism or villainy. What happened was just an undignified slaughter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My father bought a counterfeit gun from Blacksteel. When he pulled the trigger, it exploded and did a number on him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My grandfather fell to the ground. My father drew his knife with his injured hand, but the first stab went wide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard everything from the doorway. Hoarse curses, groans of pain...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The commotion lasted for a long time before it finally ended.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "In that moment, I was exhausted. Exhausted with everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I decided to leave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you telling me that Lungmen is your home now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know. I can't say for sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I at least know I had a pretty good time there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just like you were back then. Blunt, and straight to the point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like I'm the one getting ahead of myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here I was thinking you came to ask for my help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or at least, you'd want to catch up with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in the end, you're here to tell me... that we can never go back\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, Cellinia, that's awfully heartless of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was shocked when I heard you were still alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you went ahead and stamped out my hope, all over again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giovanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Giovanna.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to be Siracusan, or Columbian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just want to be Cellinia Texas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
